       &quot;enabled&quot;: false,
       &quot;selector&quot;: &quot;source.go&quot;,
      },
     }
    }<p>From what you built so far, do you think there&#x27;s any appetite in people paying for this type of tool which lets you spin up infra on demand and gives you all the capabilities built so far? I&#x27;m skeptical and I may just release it all as OSS when it gets closer to being v1.0.
